WEBVTT

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:05.270
My broken, pale wings

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:12.870
You're just a little tired of the sky that's too blue

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:17.870
It's not for anyone else anymore

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:30.000
I smile for myself

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:50.160
Ichigo, you're probably doing something important.

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:30.000
- Is that yours? - Yes.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:34.200
You should be more careful.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:03:00.000
We can't get out of the field, it looks like they're from high school.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.200
Sorry, it's our turn to use the field

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:11.980
Who are you who reserve the field to be able to train?

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:15.300
Well, they did not reserve it with us

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:23.160
We will not leave this field and please go to use the abandoned lot on the other side

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:29.350
Why don't you do it? It's our turn to train in the field. These are the rules

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:38.830
Ah, please. You are always reserving the field, although you don't really need it, so we can only train when we take it this way.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:44.710
What makes you think that we don't need the field? Training is as important to us as it is for you.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:45.630
That's right.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:46.470
Yes, true!

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.370
What's going on? What's going on?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.890
Listen, out of our field, children. Go back to elementary school.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.290
Ah, this is bad, Karin.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.890
Maybe if we study elementary school.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.120
Rules are rules.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.000
Like this?

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:06.970
An abandoned lot is enough for you. You have no idea what it is to train.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.510
Of course we do! We have more ideas than you!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.980
You don't even respect the rules!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:18.090
Forget it! Bad players shouldn't bother to train!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:21.330
Seriously? You and the others think they're better than us?

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.180
Of course we are, silly girl!

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:25.190
That was enough.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:28.450
If you have so much confidence, why don't we play?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.570
Play?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:37.780
Yes, team against team. The winning team will stay in the field and will be able to train whenever they want from now on.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.510
What do we do?

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.180
Forget it, don't do it!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.180
We'll lose.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.020
It's well done.

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:43.860
WHAT?!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.700
Are you crazy? Forget it!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.580
Why not?

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.340
What are you afraid of?

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:53.910
Excellent! We'll play on Saturday! The winning team will win the field!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:58.750
And if they lose, we'll make them eat grass on their noses!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.000
WHAT?!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:05.970
nose? deal done just make sure not to retire

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:12.360
Karin what are we going to do? you got us in a huge mess what are we going to do? we are going to

00:05:12.360 --> 00:05:16.660
win that we will do but if we lose we will have to eat grass by the nose

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:24.660
let's make sure we win so we don't have to do it but how? having more

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:29.700
team spirit than them the team spirit does not kick balls

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.510
We have to think of a kind of plan.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.090
I know!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.150
Why don't we ask your brother to play with us?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:38.650
Huh?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.660
Surely Ichigo is a better player than all of us!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:48.710
That's right! The other team is for high school students. Let's get an older student to help us win!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:00.000
No, my brother can't help us now because he's on a trip.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.910
Ah, bad luck.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:08.460
Beware, I will find someone else who is good at playing.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.440
Someone else? There is no one else.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:23.080
But there must be someone.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.320
It's the boy from this morning

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:44.500
Oh, where are you going?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.420
It's me again, you took my ball, remember?

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.080
Yes

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.080
Ah, thank you very much

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.320
It was nothing

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:56.150
Hey, I wanted to ask you, what school do you study in?

00:06:56.150 --> 00:07:00.000
Huh? What are you talking about? I didn't study in any school, now leave me alone!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:02.090
Don't you see that I'm busy?

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.970
And, by chance, do you play football?

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.670
I don't know.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.670
Soon, we'll have a great game.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:11.970
Do you want to play with us?

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:15.040
Wait a minute!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.790
Why are you talking to that strange boy, Karim?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.900
Yes, just look at him!

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.890
His hair is dyed.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:23.850
You can't put someone like that in our team.

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.770
Who knows the problems it has to cause?

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:30.000
Yes, it looks like one of those juvenile criminals.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.890
Besides, he's too small to play football with us.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:34.870
What did you say?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:35.370
Huh?

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:37.030
Who do you call "small"?

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.250
He didn't want to offend you.

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.050
Hey!

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:45.560
Wait, hey!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.900
Look at that!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.810
*Gasps*

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:52.820
*Gasps*

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:27.910
I'll go.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.220
How do you dye your hair that color?

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:35.980
Yes, do you teach me how to dye my hair?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:39.100
What is your secret? I want to learn to pat like this.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.020
Listen, I'm not who they think I am.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:46.580
It's just a normal hole.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:53.490
That same feeling, again.

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:59.220
I'm the only one close.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.140
Hey, Toshiro, wait!

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.590
I have to go!

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:04.550
Hey!

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.520
I can't help you!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:10.870
Please, say yes, we train in the hill park!

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:12.370
Please, come tomorrow!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:27.370
There is not enough space to train here with all these people.

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.960
Toshiro did not arrive anyway.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.240
Yes, we'll never win the game if he doesn't play.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:39.190
Instead of playing football, we should practice our technique to eat grass.

00:09:39.190 --> 00:09:47.350
Hey, I'm going to go look for Toshiro.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.460
Hey, wait a minute, Karin!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.920
You guys keep training!

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.680
I knew I'd be here.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.660
Toshiro!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:14.670
It's you again?

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:19.080
Yes, hey, why didn't you go play with us today?

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.840
Hey, I never said I was going to help them.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.120
Besides, I actually don't have time.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:28.320
Please, you're a boy. What could you be doing to not have time?

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.800
Just get out of here.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.610
Hey, why do you always go back to the same place?

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:36.530
Do you live close by or something like that?

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.390
Actually, no.

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:52.680
I like coming here because...

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.570
It's the best view in the sky.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:59.350
Hey!

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.580
I'm listening

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.790
I told you to stop calling me Shiro

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:09.280
When you finally go to the same high school as me, I will use your full name

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.500
Never

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:18.030
Who would want to go there?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:22.160
This brings me a lot of memories

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:25.640
Memories?

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.840
What age are you?

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:29.090
That does not impugn you

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:37.290
No, wait, don't go.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.760
Huh?

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.470
How do I tell you?

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.470
I detect that there is something wrong in that direction.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:47.570
Could it be? What is it?

00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:54.810
Someone broke your hole.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.810
What's wrong, Toshiro? Something bad happens?

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:59.220
No, no, it's nothing.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.650
But you'll be there tomorrow, won't you?

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:06.240
Who knows?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:16.190
Let's go.

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.820
Now!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:21.160
Huh?

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.720
Captain!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.220
Huh?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.320
Hello!

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.510
Are you stalking someone?

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.360
No.

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:30.000
I'm just curious about something

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.960
- From down there. - What?

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.910
Captain?

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:36.910
Are you interested in a girl from the world of the living?

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:40.030
No, of course not. It's not that.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.030
Oh, please, don't be shy, Captain.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:46.030
- That's enough. - I understand, sir.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:53.460
Sometimes you have to feel alone.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.230
It's time for the game, and Toshiro isn't here.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:08.840
And worst of all, we can't find anyone else, we're lost!

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.220
That's right!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:14.780
As I told you, now we'll have to eat a lot of grass by the nose!

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:18.030
Well, maybe you'll accept an apology from us!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.630
Stop whining!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:22.010
We got here, we have to do it!

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:27.390
What's wrong with you? Let's do this!

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.930
Yes!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:41.730
Very good, Karin!

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:51.080
Are you okay?

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.340
They're playing dirty.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:58.240
What's going on?

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.700
Do you think you're going to win?

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.620
That's what I'd like!

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.160
This is nothing!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.300
Let's go, guys, let's play!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:30.000
These high school kids are very strong, right?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.010
We are not rivals for them!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.760
Ah, nonsense! We can win this game!

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.780
What? We can't win, and less with your leg like that.

00:14:38.780 --> 00:14:43.310
What are you talking about? I already told you that I'm fine! Look!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.340
Ben! What did I tell you?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:52.340
I don't know, we should give up!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.570
Hey, look guys!

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:17.320
Shiro how can I get late and I never said that I would come who is the

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:23.720
new others we will make a replacement they got someone to help them

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:30.000
haha ready guys now we are going to kick their asses that's how they are, listen, wait

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.830
Hold on a second, I'm not here to play with you.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:36.750
Your knee, are you okay?

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.310
It's just a scratch, I'm fine, really.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:45.200
What's going on?

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.030
It's okay, I'll play. I guess you want to win, right?

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:48.980
Yes!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:54.230
Change player!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.560
That ball is mine!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:00.530
*Hashtag*

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:32.440
Ciro!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:36.170
It can't be!

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:37.170
Yes, we tied!

00:16:37.170 --> 00:16:38.540
Great!

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:50.720
You do it.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:52.060
It's your team.

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:53.850
Uh-huh.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.500
Ugh, we lost...

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.090
We did it!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.200
Congratulations!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.240
That was awesome!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.380
That was incredible!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.480
It's all thanks to you, Toshiro.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.400
You were the one who scored the winning goal.

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:22.640
Anyway, I have something to ask you.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:25.540
Hm? What? What's going on?

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.890
The other day, you looked like...

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.920
Huh?

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.110
Oh no, he's back.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.290
It's a huge hole.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.440
No, stop! It's a minus.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:52.020
You too, run!

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:58.160
Can you see that thing too?

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.670
I'll explain it to you later.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:01.190
Now he just runs!

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:02.330
I can't!

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:05.250
I can't run while my friends are in danger!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:09.970
Hey!

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.170
He didn't even feel it!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
Have you seen the same black kimono that Ichigo has?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:36.480
He is a soul-seeker.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.300
The kingdom of the frozen.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.380
Yorimaru.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:54.850
Sadness.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:58.850
With a captain in the world of the living, the holes are lost.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.230
Zero.

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:24.930
Are you okay?

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.960
Yes... and the others?

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.190
Are you okay, Donnie?

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:30.000
They're okay.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.370
Thanks to heaven.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:39.170
Toshiro, that kimono you're wearing...

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:45.550
It seems that you have a strong spiritual energy, but I never thought you could see me in this way.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:51.050
Please, tell me you know where my brother has been. I know you're a soul-seeker.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:54.630
How do you know about soul-seekers?

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:58.910
Because my brother is a soul-seeker. His name is Ichigo Kurosaki.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.000
Kurosaki?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.560
That means that you are Ichigo's younger sister!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:06.820
It makes sense.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.060
I'm sorry.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.400
Unfortunately, I don't know where Ichigo is.

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:25.040
However, I know that he is somewhere, strengthening himself.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.710
It's just like you.

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:30.000
Despite everything, he never gives up.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:32.990
Because he's the kind of person he is.

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:35.850
Don't worry.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.710
After all, he's your brother, right?

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:51.860
He's my subordinate.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.460
You have subordinates?

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:55.560
More or less.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.660
You're late, Rangiku.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.250
I'm sorry, sir.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.090
So, can this girl see us?

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.170
She's Ichigo Kurosaki's sister.

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:05.510
Her sister?

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:06.430
Yes, hello.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.690
Hello, it's a pleasure to meet you.

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:11.690
I'm Rangiku Matsumoto, Captain Hitsugaya's lieutenant.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:14.690
Wow, are you really a captain?

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.690
You're incredible, Toshiro.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.610
Although you're much younger than us.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:22.900
I told you I'm younger than you.

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:24.970
Aren't you younger?

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:26.980
How funny!

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:30.000
Hey, I'm going to tell you for the last time.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.480
I'm a little girl!

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:09.450
Captain, he did a good job helping those kids.

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:10.490
Silence.

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:12.750
He doesn't have to bother.

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:16.250
By the way, we'll help high school kids later.

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:17.290
What do you mean, later?

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.410
You'll find out later.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:20.750
I never like your surprises.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.230
Soul Seeker Guide!

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:23.150
Excellent!

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:25.590
We'll have dinner today, Okonomiyaki!

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:28.160
If you don't hurry!

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.230
Oh...

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.910
What's up Ichigo? Don't you like Okonomiyaki?

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:36.110
Yes I do, but I was waiting to eat rice tonight.

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:38.230
I also made rice! Look!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:41.100
But I thought we would have Okonomiyaki for dinner today.

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:44.430
Yes, we will have Okonomiyaki and rice tonight.

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:48.080
But the Okonomiyaki flour and rice have a lot of carbohydrates.

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:49.280
It's healthy!
